WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.109
Today we will compose a simple shared musical phrase. Our work connects with

00:00:05.109 --> 00:00:07.752
international artists and communities around the world.

00:00:08.617 --> 00:00:12.094
Write or say a short call about caring for people or places.

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:15.531
Invent an easy response of similar length.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:21.784
Practise taking turns as leader and responding group. Justify a revision using

00:00:21.784 --> 00:00:23.798
evidence from another world tradition.
